Sounds like you barely escaped your first venture into that
level. What's the hurry, it's not going away. Your +3 SDSM
should see you safely through the mines. You offer yourself
the best advice, go back to the altar and sac for Magicbane.
Now with Magicbane for the E-word and SDSM you could
probably take the bones level, but probably isn't good
enough for me if I have a choice.

Do the mines, you really want telepathy and/or see
invisible. Whatever your AC you want it lower, -15 is where
you can relax a little and prioritize other things. The
luckstone and a sac session for luck will make a big
difference.

If I was going to go ahead and use the wish, I would
strongly consider the Master Key of Thievery. It will blast
you 2d10 (keep that cloak of MR on) but it will provide 1/2
physical damage, warning and teleport control for just
keeping it in inventory. You get the last two intrinsics at
XL 15 and 17 anyway, but having them this early should be a
big help.

Sounds like a fun game, I wish I could play this part! 
